awful|Strong negative quality matches smell/window reaction without a compulsory-danger claim. Vietnamese preserves every window and causation; degree is stronger than merely below average.
gene|Inheritance/DNA function checked against NHGRI; avoids source overclaim that one gene wholly controls an organism. Protein example uses can, with multiple genes/environment caveat and faithful Vietnamese.
introduction|Opening text, acquaintance event and bringing into use have separate ordinals. Survey purpose, visitor questions and booking queues translate each boundary; not split by grammatical tense.
racist|Discriminatory adjective and person noun distinct, based on beliefs/treatment rather than ancestry. School/speaker examples oppose prejudice without quoted slurs or real-person allegations; translations preserve actions.
stream|Small watercourse and continuing series have separate ordinal support. Bridge and visitor flow contexts align; no invented precise river/stream size threshold or extra digital streaming Sense.
